00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,649
Suraj ke pehle kiran se pehle,

2
00:00:03,750 --> 00:00:07,400
Main uthti hun, tujhe yaad karte.

3
00:00:07,500 --> 00:00:11,150
Phoolon ki mehk mein teri aawaz,

4
